sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant AS as Authorization Server
    participant BUS as Revocation events
    participant RS as MCP Resource Server
    participant GW as REST API Gateway
    participant H as Host MCP client
    U->>AS: Connected apps page: disconnect Claude
    AS->>AS: set grant revoked_at, delete access tokens, revoke refresh family
    AS->>BUS: publish grant revoked, grant id
    BUS-->>RS: drop introspection cache and token B entries for the grant
    BUS-->>GW: same
    H->>RS: next tools/call with old token A
    RS->>AS: introspect
    AS-->>RS: active false
    RS-->>H: 401 invalid_token
    H->>AS: refresh attempt
    AS-->>H: invalid_grant
    Note over U,H: iOS logout revokes only the iOS grant. Each grant is revoked separately, as requirement 7.2 asks.
